{"id": "246579", "name": "דטרמיננטה ועקבה מתוך פולינום אופייני – מטריצה 2×2", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה מטריצה ריבועית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\in M_{2\\times 2}(\\mathbb{C})\\)</span> עם פולינום אופייני:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p_A(x) = |xI - A| = {{CT:0}}\\]</p></div><p>מצאו את הדטרמיננטה והעקבה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\det(A)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\text{trace}(A)=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">קריאת הדטרמיננטה והעקבה מהפולינום</b><br>לכל מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A=\\begin{bmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{bmatrix}\\)</span> מסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2\\times 2\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ p_A(x)=\\det(xI-A)=(x-a)(x-d)-bc=x^2-(a+d)\\,x+(ad-bc)=x^2-\\text{trace}(A)\\,x+\\det(A) \\]</p>כלומר המקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> הוא מינוס העקבה, והמקדם החופשי הוא הדטרמיננטה. כאן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ p_A(x)={{CT:0}} \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\det(A)={{CT:1}},\\qquad \\text{trace}(A)={{CT:2}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "myDet", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> הדטרמיננטה שהזנת נכונה.</div>"}, "on_fa